== I. 参考来源与延伸题库

- [https://www.janestreet.com/static/pdfs/trading-interview.pdf Jane Street Probability & Markets Guide] 将计数、概率、独立性、期望与条件概率列为官方面试基础。
- [https://www.janestreet.com/probability-playing-cards/ Jane Street Probability Playing Cards] 与 [https://www.janestreet.com/puzzles/ Jane Street Puzzles] 提供官方延伸练习。
- [https://stat110.hsites.harvard.edu/strategic-practice-problems Harvard Stat 110 Strategic Practice] 提供按概念组织并附解答的概率题。
- [https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/18-06sc-linear-algebra-fall-2011/ MIT 18.06] 与 [https://cs229.stanford.edu/2023_index.html Stanford CS229] 提供权威推导和练习。
- [https://github.com/manavkapadnis/ALL-ML-DS-cheatsheets/blob/master/Timothy%20Falcon%20Crack%20-%20Heard%20on%20the%20Street%2C%20Quantitative%20Questions%20from%20Wall%20Street%20Job%20Interviews%20%282014%2C%20Timothy%20Crack%29%20-%20libgen.lc.pdf Timothy Crack, /Heard on the Street/]：Q97–Q102 的期权、对冲与固定收益主题参考其对应章节后重新组织。
- [https://github.com/manavkapadnis/ALL-ML-DS-cheatsheets/blob/master/Xinfeng_Zhou-A_Practical_Guide_To_Quantitative_Finance_Interviews-CreateSpace_Independent_Publishing_Platform_%282008%29.PDF Xinfeng Zhou, /A Practical Guide to Quantitative Finance Interviews/]：Q97–Q104 综合其概率、期权、风险管理与套保主题。
- [https://github.com/manavkapadnis/ALL-ML-DS-cheatsheets/blob/master/Fifty_Challenging_Problems_in_Probability.pdf Frederick Mosteller, /Fifty Challenging Problems in Probability/]：Q93–Q96 依据书中的交替对手、Pepys 掷骰、计票与最优停止题型独立改写并推导。

*取材说明：* 上述 PDF 仅作为核对原书目录、题型与知识覆盖的资料；没有复制进本站仓库。新增题面和解析均为独立重写，并与原有 92 题的中英题面、英文 Solution 格式保持一致。

*覆盖范围：* 有限题库不可能包含所有机构的专属题目。本页刻意覆盖可迁移的模式，并吸收公开的机构信息。遇到新笔试\/面试题时，应加入错题日志，并归类到最接近的模式。
